          "text": "Eye symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Right eye red, itchy, and watery for 3 days; left eye mildly affected yesterday, symptoms mainly right-sided. Clear watery discharge, possibly stringy mucus; no purulent discharge or crusting. Prominent itch and mild gritty feeling. No significant pain, photophobia, visual change, halos, headache, nausea, or vomiting."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
