          "text": "Right eye examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Moderate conjunctival injection with perilimbal sparing; no ciliary flush. Watery mucoid discharge and mild chemosis. Lids normal, cornea clear, extraocular movements intact, pupils equal, round, and reactive to light."
      }
    },
